{"id": 1005857, "slug": "hannah-vcr", "name": "Hannah VCR", "name_original": "Hannah VCR", "description": "<p>Hannah VCR is a narrative puzzle game where you manipulate a VHS tape to change Hannah's destiny.</p><p>Each colored square on the tape represents a part of the scene. You decide the order, and Hannah moves forward alone, facing a world broken by memories, abandonment... and the search for a lost doll.</p><p>Available in two versions: </p><ul><li><p>VR: Control the tape with your own hands in an immersive environment that simulates a forgotten room.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Traditional: Use your controller on console or PC to solve each level from a classic and challenging perspective.</p></li></ul><p>With a retro aesthetic, immersive music, and an emotionally charged design, Hannah VCR is a thrilling experience filled with mystery and the things that never fully heal.</p><p>Rewind. Change the order. Maybe this time, you'll manage to save her.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-06-26", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-06-27T13:55:08", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/8d1/8d1ed357dd9c7fb1962a39bf9d3bd797.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/085/08511027af1c973bc8f1b805527df279.jpg", "website": "https://hannahthegame.com/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 184, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 0, "community_rating": 0, "saturated_color": "0f